---
const helps = [
  'Música de fondo, si te apetece.',
  'Pausas siempre que las pidas.',
  'Una explicación antes de cada paso.',
];
---

<section
  id="calma"
  aria-labelledby="calma-title"
  class="px-(--gutter) pb-(--section-y)"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[90rem] items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
    <div class="calm-stage">
      <div class="calm-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h2
        id="calma-title"
        class="calm-text font-display text-calm font-medium text-balance"
      >
        Respira. Vamos a tu ritmo.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Lo que suele ayudar</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-none space-y-3 p-0 text-lg">
        {helps.map((h) => (
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span
              class="bg-accent mt-3 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <span>{h}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p class="text-ink-soft mt-6 max-w-[44ch]">
        Cuéntanos al pedir cita qué te preocupa y lo tendremos en cuenta.
      </p>
      <a
        href="#pedir-cita"
        class="bg-primary text-primary-contrast rounded-pill hover:bg-primary-hover mt-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center px-7 font-semibold transition-colors duration-(--duration-fast)"
      >
        Pedir cita
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .calm-stage {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: min(100%, 28rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .calm-ring {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
  }
  .calm-text {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  /* The one playful moment: a slow CSS breath. Static when motion is reduced. */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .calm-ring {
      animation: breathe var(--duration-breathe) var(--ease-in-out-soft)
        infinite;
    }
  }
  @keyframes breathe {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      transform: scale(1.12);
    }
  }
</style>
